    skos:definition "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:hasEndInstant is functional: a gmeow:TimeInterval terminates at a single reified gmeow:Instant, mirroring the singular gmeow:endedAtTime it reifies, and an open-ended interval omits it rather than naming two ends."@x-gmeow-english ;
